  "createdAt" : 1762980925,
  "description" : "This dataset contains staff attendance data from 2025 onward, as reported by districts at the end of each school year. In this dataset, an absence is defined as missing more than half of the workday for time that falls outside of paid vacation time or district-approved professional activities. All employees reported on the staff roster are included in the All Staff category, not just Administrators and Teachers. Staff may appear in multiple categories. Please see the <a href=\"https://www.doe.mass.edu/infoservices/data/epims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Staff Attendance FAQ</a> for more information.\n\nIn instances where a cell is blank, data is suppressed due to one of the following reasons:<ul><li>The number of staff in a category was fewer than 6</li><li>Either an Administrators or Teachers count was 1 and the All Staff category equaled the Administrators and Teachers count. In these instances, only the All Staff category is displayed.</li></ul>This dataset contains the same data that is also published on our DESE Profiles site: \n<a href=\"https://profiles.doe.mass.edu/statereport/staffattendance.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Staff Attendance Report</a>",
